                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a short visual novel that focuses on the life of an emperor and his sister. So what's good about this game, and what's not. Well..\n\nPros:\n- a little art of slightly undressed women, i guess..\n\nCons:\n- Horrible soundtrack, repeats every god damn minute\n- Uninspired writing, with grammar mistakes and dull language\n- Subpar art at best\n- Writing that tells a rubbish story without more or less any substance or reason\n- Throwing in lines about killing people for fun + lesbian and incest things without explaining why, and without it adding anything to the story. Just having it there for the lol's i guess\n\nThat's more or less what this game is, i would not reccomend buying it. Not even at this price, simply because you would be wasting your time. And as a final note, you can change three sound settings in the options menu. You can change music, speech and \"effects\". Yet, the only sound in-game is a really annoying soundtrack... Wonder where the other sound elements are, maybe they are in the next game.. If you want to look at it some more, you can check out my youtube video of it below.\n\nGameplay video: https://youtu.be/FkADB9gC1Rk",
